            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Rayman, Globox, and the Teensies discover a mysterious tent filled with captivating paintings, they are suddenly transported to a series of mythical realms!<br><br>A LEGENDARY PLATFORMING ADVENTURE<br>Dash through 5 vibrant worlds, from a towering beanstalk to the heights of Mount Olympus. Free the kidnapped Teensies, discover hidden secrets, and uncover the secrets of the legendary paintings.<br><br>4-PLAYER LOCAL CO-OP<br>Bring up to 3 friends along for the ride! Work together to rescue Teensies, race for Lums, or slap anything that gets in your way. Need a break from the action? Settle the score on the pitch in Kung Foot.<br><br>EPIC BOSS BATTLES<br>Face off against towering dragons, masked giants, and other larger-than-life foes in action-packed showdowns. Stay on your toes, dodge their attacks, and strike when they least expect it!<br><br>ROCKIN’ RAYMAN<br>Jump to the beat of a drum, punch to the bass line, or zip-line during guitar riffs across unforgettable musical maps set to rock anthems, fiery salsa rhythms, and more, where timing and rhythm are key! </p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Rayman, Globox, and the Teensies discover a mysterious tent filled with captivating paintings, they are suddenly transported to a series of mythical realms!<br><br>A LEGENDARY PLATFORMING ADVENTURE<br>Dash through 5 vibrant worlds, from a towering beanstalk to the heights of Mount Olympus. Free the kidnapped Teensies, discover hidden secrets, and uncover the secrets of the legendary paintings.<br><br>4-PLAYER LOCAL CO-OP<br>Bring up to 3 friends along for the ride! Work together to rescue Teensies, race for Lums, or slap anything that gets in your way. Need a break from the action? Settle the score on the pitch in Kung Foot.<br><br>EPIC BOSS BATTLES<br>Face off against towering dragons, masked giants, and other larger-than-life foes in action-packed showdowns. Stay on your toes, dodge their attacks, and strike when they least expect it!<br><br>ROCKIN’ RAYMAN<br>Jump to the beat of a drum, punch to the bass line, or zip-line during guitar riffs across unforgettable musical maps set to rock anthems, fiery salsa rhythms, and more, where timing and rhythm are key! </p>",
            "short_description": "In this award-winning platforming adventure, run, jump, and slap through the colorful worlds of the Glade of Dreams, face epic bosses, and team up in 4-player local co-op.",
            "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Danish<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
